{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-24T00:28:24.987Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"grok-4.7","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"3f98104392d35363ff109b91","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"grok-4.7","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-24T00:28:24.987Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-24T00:28:24.986Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"With fetched tags, the unflagged generator keeps the two published itemless dependency bullets and omits 27 dependency bullets from release windows that already have tracked items. Passing --dependency-updates restores all 27 (published dependency PRs 2, 3, 4, 6, 9, 10, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19, 20, 23, 24, 25, 26, 27, 28, 29, 36, 37, 39, 41, 42, 43, 54). Removing only the flag from the package scripts fails the changelog entry-point regression. Restoring the flag makes that test pass, 1/1. Typecheck, lint and the identity gate passed. Focused Node tests passed 10/10."}]}],"before_hash":"5a6d758613dc5b39cff1b7fc2556f51683656a3b18c33dfdce69ae5dfa581276","after_hash":"101f69a388cc8a54f7ffcb8246025129297867fd2ee9cf35f94b66ba98a56684","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"263fd1b35021485a9fc94ad47805ef3b07e6711edde634e3c0271447688d60ea"}
